This project is licensed in TWO parts.

  PART A  the Generation I engine this project was forked from, and every
          shared file since -- MIT, unchanged, under its original authors'
          copyright.

  PART B  the Generation II (Gold / Silver / Crystal) components written
          for this project -- source-available for reading and for writing
          mods against, and not otherwise licensed.

Part A is the default. A file belongs to Part B only if it is named in the
Part B file list further down this document.


