  data/scripts/players_house1f.lua

  docs/CRYSTAL-INTRO.md

Generated content is not licensed by this document at all. Everything under
data/generated/ and assets/generated/ is produced on the user's own machine
from the user's own cartridge dump. It is not distributed with this software
and nobody here claims it.


=============================================================================
THIRD-PARTY MATERIAL -- covered by neither part
=============================================================================

tools/rom_manifest_gold.json, tools/rom_manifest_silver.json and
tools/rom_manifest_crystal.json are symbol tables derived from the pret
disassemblies (pret/pokegold, pret/pokecrystal). They carry no original
authorship of this project's and are deliberately NOT in Part B; they are
reproduced with attribution only, and will be removed on request from their
authors.

data/palettes_gbc.lua is derived from pokered-gbc by FroggestSpirit, Drenn
and Danny-E. data/palettes_yellow.lua is derived from the pret/pokeyellow
disassembly. Neither upstream project publishes a licence, so those two files
are reproduced with attribution only and are not relicensed by this document.

mobile/android/love/ vendors LÖVE for Android, SDL2, oboe and LuaJIT, each
under its own licence as shipped in that subtree.

mods/ holds separately authored mods, each under the licence in its own
directory.


